# English code comments

All comments in source files must be written in English. This includes Astro, JavaScript, TypeScript, CSS, HTML, and any other code files.

- Translate or write comments in English only.
- Keep visitor-facing website copy in Czech. Do not translate UI strings, JSON values in `src/i18n`, alt texts, or aria labels.
- Do not add comments unless they explain non-obvious intent.
- Do not treat README or user documentation as code comments.
